{"speciesId":358,"names":{"fr":"Éoko","es":"Chimecho","en":"Chimecho","ja":"チリーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CHIMECHO makes its cries echo inside its hollow body. When this POKéMON becomes enraged, its cries result in ultrasonic waves that have the power to knock foes flying."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"In high winds, CHIMECHO cries as it hangs from a tree branch or the eaves of a building using a suction cup on its head. This POKéMON plucks berries with its long tail and eats them."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses cris se répercutent dans son corps creux avant d’exploser en notes mélodieuses et saisissantes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses cris se répercutent dans son corps creux avant d’exploser en notes mélodieuses et saisissantes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se suspend sous une branche ou un auvent avec la ventouse de sa tête. Son langage comporte sept cris."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se cuelga de ramas y aleros con la ventosa de su cabeza. Tiene siete tipos de gritos diferentes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の 吸盤で 木の 枝や 家の 軒下に ぶら下がる。 ７種類 音色を 使い分ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il émet des cris à ultrasons et chevauche le vent pour parcourir de grandes distances."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Emite ondas ultrasónicas que le permiten flotar en el viento para viajar grandes distancias."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"超音波の 鳴き声を 持つ。 ふわふわと 浮かび 風に 乗って 長い 距離を 旅する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Éoko fait résonner son cri dans son corps creux. Lorsque ce Pokémon est en colère, les échos de son cri génèrent des ultrasons capables d’envoyer voler des ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chimecho hace que sus gritos resuenen con eco en su interior. Cuando se enfada, los chillidos se convierten en ondas ultrasónicas capaces de derribar a los enemigos voladores."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chimecho makes its cries echo inside its hollow body. When this Pokémon becomes enraged, its cries result in ultrasonic waves that have the power to knock foes flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"声を 体の 空洞に 反響させる。 怒った ときの 鳴き声は 敵を 吹き飛ばす 威力を 持った 超音波に なるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’il y a beaucoup de vent, Éoko pousse des cris, accroché à une branche ou à un auvent par une ventouse placée sur sa tête. Ce Pokémon attrape des Baies avec sa longue queue pour les manger."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando hay viento fuerte, Chimecho chilla colgado de la rama de un árbol o de los aleros de un edificio por la ventosa que tiene en la cabeza. Este Pokémon usa la larga cola que tiene para agarrar bayas y comérselas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In high winds, Chimecho cries as it hangs from a tree branch or the eaves of a building using a suction cup on its head. This Pokémon plucks berries with its long tail and eats them."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"風が 強くなると 木の 枝や 軒下に 頭の 吸盤で ぶら下がり 鳴き出す。 長い シッポで きのみを つまんで 食べる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Can emit waves of air powerful enough to knock out prey taller than itself. I hypothesize that it amplifies the faint sound of wind within its body."}],"varieties":[{"id":358,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[5,"level-up",17],[6,"level-up",17],